{
  "name": "MAVILERA: Pico 2 Laboratory",
  "short_name": "MAVILERA",
  "description": "A Raspberry Pi Pico 2 with the RP2350's two Hazard3 RISC-V cores: an assembler and MAVILERA's C subset, every instruction timed by Hazard3's documented cycle counts with a view of its three-stage pipeline, and the chip's GPIO, UART, timers, PWM, DMA, ADC, SPI, I2C and PIO in real time, with a lab kit of sensors and a display, sound from a pin, templates and practice exercises. Checked against an RP2350 emulator, Hazard3's hardware design and the RISC-V architecture tests.",
